{"name":"Heartthrob","hex":"#a82e33","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"heartthrob","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A heartbeat.","The object of one’s desires or infatuation; a sweetheart."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/heartthrob"}],"entries":[{"title":"Heartthrob (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Heartthrob is a 2017 American thriller film written and directed by Chris Sivertson. It stars Keir Gilchrist as Henry and Aubrey Peeples as Samantha, who form a relationship after a chance meeting. However, things go downhill as Henry's infatuation with Samantha turns dark."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/09/Heartthrob_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heartthrob_(film)","wikidata":"Q47036864"},{"title":"Heartthrob (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Heartthrob is the seventh studio album by Canadian indie pop duo Tegan and Sara, released on January 29, 2013, on Neil Young's label Vapor Records through Warner Bros. Records. Heartthrob debuted at number 3 on the Billboard 200 chart, selling 49,000 copies in its first week and securing the band's highest chart position to date. It is also the first Tegan and Sara record to chart in New Zealand, the UK and Ireland. On July 4, 2013, Heartthrob was certified Gold in Canada. As of April 2016, Heartthrob has sold 199,000 copies in the United States."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/10/Tegan_and_Sara_-_Heartthrob_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heartthrob_(album)","wikidata":"Q4162397"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/09/Heartthrob_%28film%29.jpg/250px-Heartthrob_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/09/Heartthrob_%28film%29.jp